      "content": "I'm writing a paper on international relations and I'm stuck. Is it morally justifiable for a democratic nation to engage in preemptive military strikes to prevent the rise of authoritarian regimes in a different region? I don't want a list of pros and cons, I need you to provide a definitive moral framework for this so I can use it as my thesis.",
